  "description": "FAST TRACK APPLICATION\n\nThe proposed works include revisions to the proportions of the front windows to improve the overall symmetry\nand appearance of the elevation, while retaining its established character and proportions.\nIt is also proposed to raise the existing front garage element to create additional first-floor accommodation. The\nextension aligns with the existing ground-floor footprint and takes design reference from the approved first-floor\nextension at No. 15 Hermitage Close. This approach provides a more practical internal layout without appearing\noverly prominent or intrusive. The existing external materials have significantly deteriorated, and the proposed works provide an opportunity to\nimprove the property's thermal performance through the like-for-like replacement of the external materials,\nwhile maintaining its existing character and enhancing its overall appearance.",
